   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender equality and female empowerment initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Participation Initiative is to promote an integrated and strategic approach that responds to gender inequalities in Zambia. The Initiative seeks to strengthen the coordination of an integrated and multi-sectoral approach to the design and implementation of gender equality and women leadership programmes across sectors; in line with the aspirations of the new National Gender Policy (2022) and the 8th National Development Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
